{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"990500010010","name":"冬優子","text":"………………ん、んん……？","trans":"………………嗯、嗯嗯……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010030","name":"冬優子","text":"…………バカ面ふたり","trans":"…………两个傻样","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010040","name":"冬優子","text":"ったく、悩みなんてなんもなさそーな寝顔ね……\r\n…………ふあ","trans":"真是的，一张完全看不出有什么烦恼的睡脸呢……\n…………呼啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010050","name":"愛依","text":"ん……？\r\nあれ……？","trans":"嗯……？\n咦……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010060","name":"愛依","text":"あー……今日、朝早かったもんね\r\n……ふたりとも、お疲れ","trans":"啊——……今天早上起得早嘛\n……你们俩，辛苦了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010070","name":"愛依","text":"…………いやー……\r\nかわいい子は寝顔もかわいい……","trans":"…………哎呀——……\n可爱的孩子连睡脸都很可爱……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010080","name":"愛依","text":"…………やば、うちも眠……","trans":"…………糟了，我也困了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010090","name":"あさひ","text":"…………………\r\n…………………重い……","trans":"…………………\n…………………好重……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010100","name":"あさひ","text":"むー、わたしは枕じゃないっすよ\r\nねえ、ふたりと──…………………","trans":"唔——，我不是枕头哦\n喂，你们俩——…………………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010110","name":"あさひ","text":"…………今日だけっすよ","trans":"…………就今天哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010120","name":"あさひ","text":"………………\r\nわたしも、あとちょっとだけ……","trans":"………………\n我也，就再睡一小会儿……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"990500010130","name":"あさひ","text":"おやすみっす……\r\n冬優子ちゃん、愛依ちゃん","trans":"晚安……\n冬优子，爱依","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa